The filter_arr_naive kernel in main.cu is new code written for this
repository (a naive, uncoordinated-atomicAdd baseline for the same
stream-compaction operation, added to contrast with the warp-aggregated
technique above -- it is not present in, and is not derived from, the
upstream file). All other files in this directory (Makefile,
CMakeLists.txt, reference.h, the host driver code and
filter_arr_naive kernel in main.cu, and README.md) are original to this
repository and released under the repository's main license (MIT).
